title: A caret in an empty file, at column 5001 of a long line, on line 12000 and past the end of a file types where it should
folders: odd-files
limit: 60
forbid-log: cannot edit
expect-file: odd-files/empty.txt :: (?-i)\Ahello\z
expect-file: odd-files/long_line.txt :: (?-i)\ASTARTx{5000}END\nshort\n\z
expect-file: odd-files/big.rs :: (?-i)\{ 11998 \}\n// last\npub fn f11999\(\) -> usize \{ 11999 \}// past the end\n\z
expect-file: odd-files/big.rs :: (?-i)\Apub fn f0\(\) -> usize \{ 0 \}\npub fn f1\(\)

wait 4000
edit empty.txt 5 5
type hello
wait 300
mark empty
wait 400
key save
wait 500
edit long_line.txt 1 5001
type END
wait 500
mark long-end
wait 400
edit long_line.txt 1 1
type START
key save
wait 500
edit big.rs 12000 1
type // last
key enter
wait 500
mark big-last
wait 400
edit big.rs 99999 99
type // past the end
wait 500
mark big-past-end
wait 400
key save
wait 1000
quit
